# find-untranslated.py rewrites these on every run, so tracking them means
# every suite run dirties the tree with output nobody reads from the repo.
# The report that matters is the printed one, and test-i18n-coverage.py's
# exit code is what the suite judges.
untranslated-report-*.json
# find-admin-untranslated.py's own output, same reasoning.
admin-untranslated-*.json
